(https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
src/server/graph-tools.ts is a TypeScript port of graphify.serve 0.9.66 (query_graph, get_node,
get_neighbors, shortest_path). Changes: ported from Python to TypeScript; runs over a merged
multi-repository graph; community, attributes, rationale and learning-overlay features removed.

Graphify itself is not bundled: the indexer runs it through uvx at index time.
